<header><div><div class="eyebrow">Ten frames · One game</div><h1>Bowling Scorecard</h1></div><button class="secondary" id="reset">New game</button></header>
<p>Enter the pins knocked down on each roll. We’ll handle the bonuses.</p>
<section class="panel" aria-label="Game scorecard">
